# param_changed with a negotiated raw video Format (no modifier, modern server, graphics source): the plugin logs the
# negotiated format and answers with: VideoCrop meta, Cursor meta (size range 64x64 default / 1x1 .. 1024x1024), a Buffers
# param allowing MemPtr|DmaBuf, a Header meta and (server >= 0.3.62) a VideoTransform meta. After this the size is known.
unique_name :1.5
prop ScreenCast AvailableSourceTypes "uint32 1"
prop ScreenCast version "uint32 2"
screencast_load
pw_server_version 1.2.0
new a pipewire-desktop-capture-source
portal_ok 31
param_changed format=BGRx size=1280x720 fps=30/1
size a
